  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "T.Pradeep Kumar, vs The State Of A.P on 17 September, 2021 Honourable Smt. Justice Lalitha Kanneganti Criminal Petition No.3073 of 2021 Order:",
    "facts": "The case of the prosecution is that 27.05.2020 the Station House Officer, Nallapadu Police Station along with staff and mediators while checking the vehicles at Etukuru Junction, NH- 16 flyover Nallapadu, they found a TATA Safari car bearing No.AP 07 BN 8586 and on seeing the police, the driver tried to take back the vehicle, police obstructed the driver, then he got down and tried to stab the police with a knife. The driver was taken control by other police personnel. On verification of the vehicle, they found 25 bags of tobacco products and 5 KGs of ganja and seized the same under the cover of a mediators report. Basing on the said report, present crime was registered.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner/A-2 submits that petitioner is unconnected with the alleged offences. He submits that there is no material to show that driver is employed by the petitioner and the vehicle belongs to him. Only basing on confession of other accused, petitioner is implicated. He further submits that petitioner will co-operate with the investigation and abide by any conditions imposed by this Court. Hence, the petitioner's case may be considered for pre-arrest bail. 5. Learned Assistant Public Prosecutor submits that 5 KGs of ganja is seized in the crime, he is not entitled for pre-arrest bail.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner/A-2 submits that petitioner is unconnected with the alleged offences. He submits that there is no material to show that driver is employed by the petitioner and the vehicle belongs to him. Only basing on confession of other accused, petitioner is implicated.",
    "respondent_arguments": "He further submits that petitioner will co-operate with the investigation and abide by any conditions imposed by this Court. Hence, the petitioner's case may be considered for pre-arrest bail. 5. Learned Assistant Public Prosecutor submits that 5 KGs of ganja is seized in the crime, he is not entitled for pre-arrest bail.",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
